# FishE - the bank: "You're at the front of the line and the teller asks you
# what you want to do." No figures are drawn: the ledger lies open on the
# counter. Provisional art (RFC 0025): see stills.json.
size 640 360
camera 5.0 4.4 5.4  -0.5 0.7 -0.9  50 0.1 200
lighting sun 0.5 54 4 2048 30 0.6 1
clear 0 0 0 1 sky
include _room.scene
